dd2b\ud83d\udc80\nYOUR ULTIMATE INTENSE VR ZOMBIE APOCALYPSE SIMULATOR!\n\n\ud83e\udddf FACE 5 ZOMBIE TYPES from shambling Walkers to massive Boss monsters! Survive 10 STORY MISSIONS + INFINITE HORDE MODE across 5 MASSIVE MAPS:\n\u2705 Urban Decay: Blast through hyper-realistic city chaos!\n\u2705 Neon Nightmare: Light up glowing zombies in a vibrant cyberpunk wasteland!\n\u2705 Frozen Outpost: Survive the icy terror and snowy silence!\n\u2705 Abandoned Asylum: Close-quarters horror around every corner!\n\u2705 Radioactive Ruins: Mutated threats in a toxic environment!\n\n\ud83d\udd25 KEY FEATURES:\n\ud83e\udddf THRILLING RUN-&-GUN GAMEPLAY: Intense action from start to finish! Smash through hordes, dodge lethal projectile attacks, and execute perfect headshots for massive damage!\n\ud83c\udfae IMMERSIVE VR MECHANICS: Realistic physics-based weapon handling, dynamic weather effects, and a complete day/night cycle that changes the zombies' behavior and aggression!\n\ud83c\udf0d OPEN-ARENA COMBAT: Roam freely through ultra-detailed, explorable environments to find ammo, health packs, and strategic choke points!\n\ud83d\udca5 ADAPT OR DIE: Each zombie type requires a different strategy. Kite the Runners, focus-fire the Tanks, and always watch your back!\n\ud83d\udcaf ZERO PAYWALLS: All weapons, maps, and modes are 100% FREE & UNLOCKABLE through gameplay!\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 PERFECT FOR: #VRShooter fans \ud83c\udfae #MetaQuest explorers \ud83c\udf10 #ZombieGame addicts \ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f #ActionGaming\n\n\ud83d\udc49 DOWNLOAD NOW!\nOnly on the Meta Horizon Store\nSearch: \ud83d\udd0e \"Zombie Fitness\"\n\nQuest 2/3/Pro ", "short_description": "Zombie Fitness \ud83d\udd2b\ud83d\udc80\nULTIMATE VR ZOMBIE SHOOTER! Wield 5 weapons & survive 10 story missions + endless hordes across 5 massive maps! Realistic physics, dynamic weather & total exploration. 100% FREE content!\n\n#VRShooter #MetaQuest\n\nDOWNLOAD NOW!\nMeta Horizon Store"}]}, "developer_name": null, "deve